      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "As shown in Fig 1, most studies included a computational system dynamics simulation model (n = 21; 66%), while the remaining studies (n = 11; 34%) used only diagramming approaches (referred to as diagram-only studies in this review).",
      "reason": "The review specifies that studies were grouped for synthesis based on the modeling approach used (simulation vs. diagram-only)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "This search period was selected to reflect recent developments and current applications of system dynamics modeling related to cancer.",
      "reason": "The review provides a rationale for the restriction on the publication date (last 10 years) to ensure the review reflects recent developments."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 100
}

